NC Digital creates professional logos and brand identities for businesses in Newport and across South Wales. Every logo is designed from scratch by hand — no AI tools, no template shortcuts.

## Building a brand in Newport

Newport is a growing city with an increasingly competitive business environment. Whether you're a tradesperson, a retailer, a professional firm, or a new start-up, a professionally designed logo sets the tone for everything else — your website, your marketing, your signage, your uniforms.

Getting your logo right from the start saves you time and money later. A well-designed identity that works at any size, in any colour, across any platform is an asset your business will use for years.

## What's included

Every logo project includes:

- 5 initial logo concepts covering different directions and styles
- Revisions until you're completely satisfied
- Brand colour palette and typography
- Brand guidelines document
- All file formats: PNG, SVG, PDF, JPEG — for web and print

Full details on our [logo design service](/services/logo-design/) page.

## No AI. Designed by hand.

Every logo is drawn in Adobe Illustrator — no AI-generated artwork, no stock icon libraries. Your logo is original, vector-based, and built to scale.

## Pair it with a website

We build websites alongside new brand identities, applying your logo, colours, and typography consistently throughout. See our [web design in Newport](/web-design-newport/) for more, or explore our [ecommerce web design for Newport businesses](/ecommerce-web-design-newport/). For nearby areas, we also offer [logo design in Ebbw Vale](/logo-design-ebbw-vale/).

## Frequently asked questions

**How much does a logo cost?**

Contact us for a fixed-price quote with no hidden costs.

**How long does it take?**

Most projects are completed within 5–10 working days.

**Do I own the logo?**

Yes. Full ownership of all files is transferred to you on completion.

**Can you build my website too?**

Yes — we offer [web design](/services/web-design/) and [web development](/services/web-development/) alongside logo design.

